task: S21 T3 — Neutral "сенсор" copy instead of DUT
requires: [FRONTEND_DEV]

context: |
  Different sensor types can exist, so user-facing copy must say "сенсор/датчик",
  not "DUT". uk.json: scanningHint "Шукаємо DUT сенсори поруч…" → "Шукаємо сенсори поруч…",
  plus permission, home subtitle, emptyBody, scan subtitle, dutSection, lockedHint.
  Mirror in ru/en. Keep internal ids/keys unchanged.

out:
  - src/locales/{uk,ru,en}.json
  - test asserting no "DUT" in user-facing locale values (allowlist if needed)

cmd:
  - bun run test

done:
  - No "DUT" in scan, home, permission, password copy
